-- supports a human assessment that is NOT already based on objective and verifiable facts: the carve-out does not reach it
#ASSERT `Art 5(1)(d) the AI practice is prohibited` (Date 3 2 2025) `Art 5(1) act use` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- objective facts but the system does not support a human assessment: the carve-out does not reach it
#ASSERT `Art 5(1)(d) the AI practice is prohibited` (Date 3 2 2025) `Art 5(1) act use` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the carve-out does not rescue a case that was never within the point (element missing)
#ASSERT `Art 5(1)(d) the AI practice is prohibited` (Date 3 2 2025) `Art 5(1) act use` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- before Article 5 applies
#ASSERT `Art 5(1)(d) the AI practice is prohibited` (Date 1 2 2025) `Art 5(1) act use` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

