§ `Article 5(1a): the limits for points (ba) and (bb)`
-- placing on the market: generation is the intended purpose, (i)
#ASSERT `Art 5(1a) the act is within the limits that paragraph 1a sets for points (ba) and (bb)` (Date 2 12 2026) `Art 5(1) act placing on the market` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- putting into service: intended purpose, whatever the safeguards
#ASSERT `Art 5(1a) the act is within the limits that paragraph 1a sets for points (ba) and (bb)` (Date 2 12 2026) `Art 5(1) act putting into service` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (ii): a reasonably foreseeable and reproducible outcome and no adequate safeguards
#ASSERT `Art 5(1a) the act is within the limits that paragraph 1a sets for points (ba) and (bb)` (Date 2 12 2026) `Art 5(1) act placing on the market` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (ii) fails: adequate safeguards exist, 'only prohibited where'
#ASSERT `Art 5(1a) the act is within the limits that paragraph 1a sets for points (ba) and (bb)` (Date 2 12 2026) `Art 5(1) act placing on the market` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- neither (i) nor (ii)
#ASSERT `Art 5(1a) the act is within the limits that paragraph 1a sets for points (ba) and (bb)` (Date 2 12 2026) `Art 5(1) act placing on the market` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the deployer's purpose does not matter to the placing on the market
#ASSERT `Art 5(1a) the act is within the limits that paragraph 1a sets for points (ba) and (bb)` (Date 2 12 2026) `Art 5(1) act placing on the market` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- use: the deployer uses the system for the purpose of generating or manipulating, (b)
#ASSERT `Art 5(1a) the act is within the limits that paragraph 1a sets for points (ba) and (bb)` (Date 2 12 2026) `Art 5(1) act use` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- use: the deployer does not use it for that purpose, 'only prohibited where the deployer uses the system for the purpose'
#ASSERT `Art 5(1a) the act is within the limits that paragraph 1a sets for points (ba) and (bb)` (Date 2 12 2026) `Art 5(1) act use` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the day before paragraph 1a applies (1 December 2026)
#ASSERT `Art 5(1a) the act is within the limits that paragraph 1a sets for points (ba) and (bb)` (Date 1 12 2026) `Art 5(1) act placing on the market` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the Omnibus text is in force on 27 July 2026 but paragraph 1a does not apply until 2 December 2026
#ASSERT `Art 5(1a) the act is within the limits that paragraph 1a sets for points (ba) and (bb)` (Date 27 7 2026) `Art 5(1) act placing on the market` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the day before the Omnibus: the text as enacted has no paragraph 1a
#ASSERT `Art 5(1a) the act is within the limits that paragraph 1a sets for points (ba) and (bb)` (Date 26 7 2026) `Art 5(1) act placing on the market` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Article 5(1)(ba)`
-- a system that generates such material of an identifiable person without consent, intended purpose
