#ASSERT `Art 5(1)(ba) the AI practice is prohibited` (Date 2 12 2026) `Art 5(1) act placing on the market` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
