§ `The combiner for Article 99 (seam S3) and the rule`
#ASSERT `Art 5(1) the AI practice is prohibited under one of the points` (LIST JUST TRUE, NOTHING) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 5(1) the AI practice is prohibited under one of the points` (LIST NOTHING, JUST TRUE, JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- a carve-out (JUST FALSE) is not a prohibition under another point
#ASSERT `Art 5(1) the AI practice is prohibited under one of the points` (LIST JUST FALSE, NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 5(1) the AI practice is prohibited under one of the points` (LIST NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 5(1) the AI practice is prohibited under one of the points` EMPTY EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 5(1) seam S3 the AI practice is prohibited under Article 5` (LIST JUST TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 5(1) seam S3 the AI practice is prohibited under Article 5` (LIST JUST FALSE, NOTHING))

-- EXPECT BREACH BY Operator (the prohibited practice is carried out)
#TRACE `Art 5(1) the duty not to carry out the prohibited AI practice` (JUST TRUE) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Operator DOES `Art 5(1) carry out the prohibited AI practice` AT 5
-- EXPECT FULFILLED (a carve-out applies: nothing is owed)
#TRACE `Art 5(1) the duty not to carry out the prohibited AI practice` (JUST FALSE) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Operator DOES `Art 5(1) carry out the prohibited AI practice` AT 5
-- EXPECT FULFILLED (not covered: nothing is owed)
#TRACE `Art 5(1) the duty not to carry out the prohibited AI practice` NOTHING AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Operator DOES `Art 5(1) carry out the prohibited AI practice` AT 5
-- EXPECT the duty stays on the party (MUST NOT), nothing happened
#TRACE `Art 5(1) the duty not to carry out the prohibited AI practice` (JUST TRUE) AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
